## File layout (where to save what)

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `drafts/YYYY-MM-DD.md` | Today's post body + hashtags |
| `comments/YYYY-MM-DD.md` | Up to 2 comments for today — each with target post URL + comment text |
| `connects/YYYY-MM-DD.md` | Today's connection requests — each with profile URL + personalized note |
| `storage/post-history.jsonl` | Append one line per published post (date, theme, hook). Create if missing. |
| `storage/profile/recent-posts.md` | Sahil's recent LinkedIn posts (manual paste) — used to avoid repeats. Create when first asked. |
| `storage/profile/sahil-siddiqui-profile.md` | Sahil's bio / skills / tone notes — create on first ask. |
| `prompts/daily-request.md` | Optional brief Sahil edits before asking for today's content |

Always overwrite the dated file for the current day if Sahil asks to "redo" it; never silently merge.

